# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build outputs
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Cargo build directory.
/target/
# Inno Setup installer output.
/installer/output/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# MSIX packaging
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build products of the MSIX package. Assets/ is generated too, but committed:
# packaging should not need a Rust toolchain.
/packaging/msix/layout/
/packaging/msix/out/
# Store listing images. Uploaded to Partner Center; a PNG of a window is not
# source, and the script plus the demo config beside it reproduce them. The few
# that the docs show are committed, cropped, under site/assets/screenshots/ --
# export-doc-images.ps1 makes those from these.
/packaging/msix/screenshots/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets and per-machine settings (never commit)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Test VM connection details, including the guest password.
/.secrets/
# MCP server configuration for AI agents. May contain local paths and tokens.
.mcp.json
# Claude Code per-machine settings (permission allowlist etc.).
# Project-shared files under .claude/ (skills, settings.json) stay tracked.
.claude/settings.local.json

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Logs and crash dumps
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.log
*.stackdump
